<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada weekly data.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada weekly data.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said on Friday it would delay the weekly release of the Bank of Canada excess settlement balances, Bank of Canada overnight money market financing and the Bank of Canada weekly assets and liabilities until Monday.</p>
<p>The data is normally issued on Friday mornings after being compiled on Thursday. Yesterday was Boxing Day, a public holiday in Canada.</p>
<p>It would release the Government of Canada cash balance and monetary conditions index data about an hour later than the usual time of 1315 EST this afternoon, a spokeswoman for the bank said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
